  "raw_flow": [
    "If PlayerStatusData.controllable is false, call Reset_HungUpCheck and return false.",
    "Otherwise if Player.forceControl is not false, call Reset_HungUpCheck and return false.",
    "Otherwise store the current position (via external op_Implicit) into MoveCheckPosBuf[MoveCheckPosPtr], increment MoveCheckPosRecordNum and MoveCheckPosPtr; apply rem with raw divisor 8 to MoveCheckPosPtr.",
    "Return false when MoveCheckPosRecordNum < 8.",
    "When count >= 8, accumulate eight Vector2 entries via get_zero and op_Addition, divide by raw float32 8.0, subtract current converted position, call get_magnitude, return false when bgt.un against raw Float32 bits 0x3CA3D70A takes its branch, otherwise return true.",
    "External Unity/vector computation semantics and authored interaction meanings are not promoted."
  ],
